# License-operator artifacts (local keygen tool):
#  - server_config.json holds the control-plane admin API key (GARAGEFLOW_API_KEY)
#  - licenses_db.json is the operator's local license database
# NEVER commit these. If they ever were, rotate GARAGEFLOW_API_KEY immediately.
keys/server_config.json
keys/licenses_db.json

